WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.656 --> 00:00:17.249
Roxy her tiny foot.

2
00:00:17.269 --> 00:00:20.092
"Nobody shrinks Rocket Girl!"

3
00:00:20.892 --> 00:00:22.674
The little girl now looked like a giant.

4
00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:25.236
Roxy watched the girl skip away.

5
00:00:25.256 --> 00:00:27.979
"La, la, la!"

6
00:00:28.259 --> 00:00:28.960
the girl sang.

7
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.041
Roxy flew after the girl and fired her eye laser beams.

8
00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:38.122
Whiz-hoo! The tiny laser beams bounced off the girl's neck.

9
00:00:41.063 --> 00:00:42.683
Roxy fired again and again.

10
00:00:43.344 --> 00:00:45.424
Whiz-hoo! Whiz-hoo!

11
00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:48.365
"What was that?"

12
00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:50.466
the girl said, feeling her neck.

13
00:00:50.486 --> 00:00:54.567
"It feels like mosquitoes are biting me."

14
00:00:58.108 --> 00:00:59.328
The girl skipped some more.

15
00:01:01.308 --> 00:01:03.490
Then she looked up at Metro City Grand Hotel.

16
00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:07.472
"That's a cute building!"

17
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:08.513
said the girl.

18
00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:11.415
She aimed the device at the building.

19
00:01:11.435 --> 00:01:15.418
"I have to stop this girl," thought Roxy.

20
00:01:15.438 --> 00:01:16.819
"But how?

21
00:01:17.299 --> 00:01:18.300
I'm too small."

22
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.701
Roxy thought for a moment.

23
00:01:21.442 --> 00:01:22.563
Then she had an idea.

24
00:01:24.424 --> 00:01:27.086
Zoom! Roxy flew inside the device.

25
00:01:28.026 --> 00:01:30.148
She could see all sorts of wires and gears.

26
00:01:31.316 --> 00:01:33.298
Roxy fired her eye laser beams again.

27
00:01:34.078 --> 00:01:36.700
Whiz-hoo! Ka-boom!

28
00:01:38.162 --> 00:01:41.464
Roxy flew back out as the device exploded in the girl's hand.

29
00:01:42.705 --> 00:01:44.527
The girl looked down at the broken device.

30
00:01:46.108 --> 00:01:46.728
She sniffed.

31
00:01:48.069 --> 00:01:48.770
Her lip shook.

32
00:01:49.491 --> 00:01:50.671
Tears filled her eyes.

33
00:01:50.691 --> 00:01:55.175
"Waa-aa! Waa-aa!"

34
00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:56.096
the girl cried.

35
00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.140
"My shrink ray is broken!"

36
00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:04.601
Suddenly a man and woman ran toward her.

37
00:02:05.601 --> 00:02:07.281
They were both wearing space suits.

38
00:02:07.301 --> 00:02:11.022
"Abba!" said the man.

39
00:02:11.042 --> 00:02:13.703
"Your mom and I were looking for you."

40
00:02:13.723 --> 00:02:17.944
"The shrink ray is broken!"

41
00:02:18.444 --> 00:02:19.105
Abba cried.

42
00:02:19.125 --> 00:02:22.145
"You're not supposed to play with that!"

43
00:02:22.525 --> 00:02:23.466
said the girl's mom.

44
00:02:24.886 --> 00:02:26.547
Her dad looked around and frowned.

45
00:02:26.567 --> 00:02:31.348
"You shrank a bunch of things for your collection, didn't you?"

46
00:02:32.536 --> 00:02:33.157
Abba nodded.

47
00:02:33.177 --> 00:02:36.718
"You shouldn't do that," said her mom.

48
00:02:37.939 --> 00:02:40.060
"I'm sorry," said Abba.

49
00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:43.642
"You're grounded," said her dad.

50
00:02:44.483 --> 00:02:45.683
Abba's mom rubbed her chin.

51
00:02:45.703 --> 00:02:49.245
"I'll get the un-shrink ray."

52
00:02:50.446 --> 00:02:51.947
Roxy flew up to Abba's mom.

53
00:02:51.967 --> 00:02:55.429
"Hi!" said Roxy.

54
00:02:55.449 --> 00:02:58.050
"Can you un-shrink people?"

55
00:02:59.171 --> 00:03:01.352
"Of course," said Abba's mom.

56
00:03:02.384 --> 00:03:05.445
"And all the buildings and everything else too."

57
00:03:05.465 --> 00:03:07.866
"Great!" said Roxy.

58
00:03:08.526 --> 00:03:09.566
She thought for a second.

59
00:03:09.586 --> 00:03:13.407
"There's one building that can stay small though."

60
00:03:15.508 --> 00:03:17.368
Metro City was soon back to normal.

61
00:03:18.348 --> 00:03:20.389
Everything and everyone was the right size.

62
00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.710
Abba and her parents returned to space.

63
00:03:29.751 --> 00:03:31.692
Roxy and her friends walked home from school.

64
00:03:34.124 --> 00:03:34.884
"Look!" cried Mara.

65
00:03:34.904 --> 00:03:37.365
"The old theater is gone!"

66
00:03:37.385 --> 00:03:40.206
"Wow," said Jack.

67
00:03:40.226 --> 00:03:43.647
"Maybe people can plant that community garden now."

68
00:03:45.287 --> 00:03:47.468
Terrell looked at the empty lot suspiciously.

69
00:03:47.488 --> 00:03:51.449
"I wonder if Rocket Girl had something to do with this."

70
00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.610
Roxy smiled.

71
00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:54.930
"Who knows?

72
00:03:56.631 --> 00:03:57.751
But there's the bakery!

73
00:03:58.352 --> 00:03:59.552
Let's buy some cookies!"
